# Optional. Adds Windy's global webcam catalogue to the map.
#
# Everything else needs no key at all — the 511 traveler-information
# feeds, Caltrans, Transport for London and the Alaska Volcano
# Observatory are all open. Without a Windy key the map still works, but
# coverage is North America and London only, and the observatory / zoo /
# landmark cameras stay missing, since almost all of those are
# stream-only outside Windy.
#
# Free key: https://api.windy.com/webcams
# WINDY_API_KEY=
